crm.learners field 1: learner_id | internal | The learner's ID, which the platform's other tables use for the learner. Identifies a person through this table's personal columns.
crm.learners field 3: email | personal | The email the learner signs in with.
crm.learners field 5: country | internal | The learner's country, as an ISO 3166 two-letter code.
crm.learners field 6: city | personal | The learner's city. Identifying together with date of birth.
